<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit wins 36 mln ATS order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit wins 36 mln ATS order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>VA Technologie AG unit Voest Alpine Transport- und Montagesysteme (VA TMS) said on Tuesday it had won a 36 million schillings order to supply a driverless transport system to papermaker KNP Leykam.</p>
<p>VA TMS said in a statement it expected to complete delivery of the system and vehicles to KNP Leykam's plant near Graz, southern Austria, in September 1997. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
